                "Facilities moved your manager {slot}. I saw the boxes.",
                "Your manager? {slot}. Unless they got reorged while we talked.",
            ],
            role_clues: [
                "Your new manager is the {role}. Is that a person or a team?",
                "The email said you report to the {role}. It was a long email.",
                "Pretty sure it's the {role}. I'm also pretty sure about nothing anymore.",
